//NOTE TO ALL TRANSLATORS
//ALL lines of dialogue here will be included in the i18n file, and the game will pull THOSE lines from there, due to the dynamic dialogue that Katrielle uses
//Please use the default.json file as a basis for the translation for every dialogue.
//Thank you, and I apologize for the inconvenience.

